sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TR as Past runs<br/>trace · result.json
    participant AN as analysis/<br/>trajectories · metrics
    participant RF as Reflector
    participant G as Lesson gates
    participant L as lessons/
    participant EV as A/B eval<br/>with placebo arm

    AN->>TR: rebuild every build: coder runs, tool calls, issue lifecycles
    AN->>AN: process metrics + root-cause failure taxonomy
    Note over AN: spatial: 72% of issues<br/>placement / proportion<br/>fixed only 43–45%
    AN->>RF: all cases of one failure category
    RF-->>G: 2–5 candidate lessons + cited cases
    G->>G: static → generality (≥ 2 tasks) → dedup
    G->>L: store 9 lessons
    L->>EV: frozen snapshot, three interleaved arms
    alt CI entirely below 0
        EV-->>L: enable by default
    else CI crosses 0 (this result)
        EV-->>L: keep disabled: the gate rejected this evolution
    end
